I'll design and implement the most high-leverage feature for Claimr to transform it into an AI-driven operations assistant for AV teams. After analyzing the options, I'll focus on the **Org-Scoped Learning Vaults** as it offers the strongest combination of short and long-term value.

# Org-Scoped Learning Vaults: Implementation

This feature creates private memory banks per integrator (like CTI, AVI-SPL), evolves agent behavior based on firm-level history, and enables personalization and training per organization.

## Why This Feature?

The Org-Scoped Learning Vaults provide immediate value by personalizing the Claimr experience for each AV integrator while building toward long-term adoption. It creates a powerful network effect where the platform becomes more valuable as organizations use it more, addressing the goal of becoming their daily tool and "agent" that helps techs do more with less.

